@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Green Rides

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
state "View Journey Details" as ViewJourneyDetails
state "Activate Driving Mode" as ActivateDrivingMode
state "Select Place to Eat" as SelectPlaceToEat
state "Order Food" as OrderFood
state "Accident Detected" as AccidentDetected
state "Send Notifications" as SendNotifications
state "Feedback Provided" as FeedbackProvided

Idle --> ViewJourneyDetails : user logs in and selects destination
ViewJourneyDetails --> ActivateDrivingMode : view journey details, activate driving mode or choose other options
ActivateDrivingMode --> SelectPlaceToEat : user is hungry, select place to eat
SelectPlaceToEat --> OrderFood : view menu, place order if hungry
OrderFood --> SendNotifications : order placed, send notifications during driving
SendNotifications --> FeedbackProvided : notify of accident, provide feedback upon journey completion

ViewJourneyDetails --> AccidentDetected : accident detected, inform relevant authorities
AccidentDetected --> SendNotifications : send accident notification
SendNotifications --> FeedbackProvided : send notifications, provide feedback upon journey completion

FeedbackProvided --> [*]
@enduml
